<title>ITALY: SOCCER-FIORENTINA V BENFICA TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FIORENTINA V BENFICA TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Italy 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the European Cup Winners' Cup quarter-final second leg on Thursday between Fiorentina of Italy and Benfica of Portugal:</p>
<p>Fiorentina: 1-Francesco Toldo; 16-Giulio Falcone, 3-Michele Serena, 4-Giovanni Piacentini, 5-Lorenzo Amoruso, 19-Pasquale Padalino, 2-Daniele Carnesciale, 7-Stefan Schwarz, 9-Gabriel Batistuta, 10-Rui Costa, 8-Francesco Baiano.</p>
<p>Benfica: 1-Michel Preud'Homme; 14-Marinho, 3-Jorge Soares, 5-Jorge Bermudez, 17-Pedro Henriques, 2-Tahar El Kalej, 6-Jamir, 10-Valdo Filho, 15-Paulao, 23-Edgar Pacheco, 8-Joao Pinto.</p>
</text>
